1. Purpose and Definitions
Web-Honeypot is a college educational project developed for learning, academic research, experimentation, and demonstration of web honeypot technologies and related security concepts.
This license is intended to make the project freely available for educational and non-commercial purposes while protecting it against unauthorized commercial exploitation.
This is a custom license. It is not an open-source license as defined by the Open Source Initiative.
'Project' means the source code, tests, scripts, documentation, and other files in this repository.
'Commercial use' means use primarily intended for commercial advantage or monetary compensation. This includes use in a paid product or service, use inside a for-profit business, consulting or paid training that includes the Project, and charging a fee for the Project itself.
Use in teaching, study, or research at a school, university, or similar educational institution is not commercial use, even if the institution charges tuition.

